      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778657570942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "交易域在产生交易流水的时候，记录下交易对手\n信息，以及该交易所对应的[业务类型-2]。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lEGOn0ZGyVUiEfX6erRYC",
      "originalText": "交易域在产生交易流水的时候，记录下交易对手信息，以及该交易所对应的[业务类型-2]。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "RAG4VrpVfWl4Tlnc4kXoA",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 2350.1012002485418,
