      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "对于现有[业务类型-1]，如果无法映射到\n[业务类型-2]，那交易域需要部分改造",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "对于现有[业务类型-1]，如果无法映射到\n[业务类型-2]，那交易域需要部分改造",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kRWfOcEYXy1e4Y17Yu9Uy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2857.82467537381,
      "y": 286.70861914006656,
      "width": 302,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ah",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1679549773,
      "version": 499,
      "versionNonce": 965201133,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1778657570942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "账务会计系统不关心[业务类型]，\n所以账务会计系统无需任何改造。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "账务会计系统不关心[业务类型]，\n所以账务会计系统无需任何改造。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
